    "Additive PROP-072 DEBUGGER-PROTOCOL clause; all previous source bytes before the closing root remain an exact prefix. No normative retirement.",
    "Four strict registered JTD roots: boot-debugger-request/result/error/progress, generated through the incumbent xtask/JTD owner. Request variants: capture, inspect, tree, explain, cost, compare, cancel, raw chunk and replay.",
    "Pure workspace projection delegates to existing static/index/compiler snapshot readers and measurement; no workspace reverse dependency.",
    "Upper host-bound route retains DocumentClient/AnalysisCapture and PageSession, validates exact context/epoch/filter/cursor, scopes resource identities to capture, keeps raw-byte basis, uses incumbent stream validation and explicit bounded replay gaps. Inspection cancellation never requests or claims build cancellation.",
    "Configured MCP contexts retain one explicit matching-root Arc route. Two independent contexts inspect the same retained snapshot with identical output. Default-unconfigured MCP remains unavailable.",
    "CLI source implements structured newline OperationEnvelope input/output and a host startup capture, but CLI binary test target does not compile until the separate policy owner registration is authorized.",
    "Cost currently reports the selected captured artifact bytes/scalars with the incumbent recipe; tokens, provider billing and ambient tail remain explicitly unavailable. It does not assert full-boot or authored-source attribution. Current compare compares retained resource content digests. Hypothetical preview is not implemented.",
    "Explicit library retain_capture can retain a host-owned immutable overlay capture; this additional composition seam has not received an independent overlay regression in this candidate."
  ],
